              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noma umshaye ngesandla sakhe ngobutha aze afe; omshayileyo wobulawa nokubulawa; ngoba ungumbulali: umphindiseli wegazi uzambulala umbulali, nxa ehlangana laye.",
