          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inhlangano kumelwe ikhulule umbulali esandleni somuntu womele igazi, futhi inhlangano kumelwe imbuyisele emzini okhululekile ayebalekele kuwo; futhi kumelwe ahlale kulo kuze kube sekufeni kompristi ophakeme ogcotshwe ngamafutha angcwele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.25",
