              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isibalo segazi samthola ngaphandle kwemingcele yomuzi wakubo okhululekile, futhi inani legazi lambulala umbulali; angabi nacala legazi;",
          "type": "text",
