              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke aniyikungcolisa izwe enikulo, ngokuba igazi liyangcolisa izwe; nezwe alinakuhlanjululwa egazini elichithwa kulo, kuphela ngegazi lalowo olichithile.",
          "type": "text",
